":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Lindy Ruff said Ryan McLeod will be back in the lineup tomorrow. He also said Alex Lyon will be on the road trip that begins Thursday in Chicago and is on target to return soon.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3mzxy7hmbds2q"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-10T17:31:57+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Lindy Ruff says Ryan McLeod will return tomorrow. Jiri Kulich would appear to be out. He mentioned he believes Kulich is still trying to find his game and that it's in there, but the handful of setbacks he's had this year, injury-wise, after all he dealt with a year ago have been a lot to deal with","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3mzxxudaock2v"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-10T16:17:25+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Sabres practicing and it’s looking like Ryan McLeod will get back in. Jiri Kulich didn’t appear to mix into any rushes and was on the PK against the top PP unit.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3mzxtp27vk22z"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-07T13:09:31+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Thoughts on the Sabres’ dominant win over the Blue Jackets. \n\n- On Ryan McLeod’s scratch and why it was a bit of a wake-up call for the whole room \n- What allowed Josh Norris to break through \n\nAnd more:","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3mzpxscczjh2g"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-06T16:34:58+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Ryan McLeod is a healthy scratch for the Sabres tonight. Sounds like Louis Crevier will also be a healthy scratch. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3mznssqczzs2r"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-05T12:10:06+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"The Sabres got “outworked” and “out-skated” in a 2-1 loss to the Senators. 5 thoughts on the blown lead.\n\n- Rasmus Dahlin’s rough night \n- More troubling signs for McLeod and Norris\n\nAnd more here:","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3mzktk76geu23"}],"team":"BUF","threads":[{"d":"2026-11-06T17:05:47+00:00","sub":"sabres","t":"[Rachel Lenzi] Ryan McLeod [on being scratched]: \"Obviously it's frustrating being out of the lineup, without the team, helping out, but it's just kind of getting back to the basics. They could tell I was struggling,…","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/sabres/comments/1xpi3p3/rachel_lenzi_ryan_mcleod_on_being_scratched/"},{"d":"2026-11-06T16:53:59+00:00","sub":"sabres","t":"[Matthew Fairburn] Looks like Jiri Kulich could be going in for Ryan McLeod tonight. McLeod wasn’t working on either of the top two PK units at morning skate. Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen in the starter’s net.","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/sabres/comments/1xphsbg/matthew_fairburn_looks_like_jiri_kulich_could_be/"}],"videos":[{"d":"2026-11-06T18:15:02+00:00","id":"G329BO4ULu0","k":"video","t":"“Going To Take A Little Mental Reset Here And Find My Game.” | Ryan McLeod | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G329BO4ULu0"},{"d":"2026-11-06T18:09:44+00:00","id":"OeTOjry1FHg","k":"video","t":"\"When He's Playing His Best, He Helps Our Hockey Team Win.\" Lindy Ruff on McLeod | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OeTOjry1FHg"}]}